{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50329","headline":"春日覊情 · 佚名","name":"春日覊情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡山临海岸，别业近天堄。\n地接龙塠北，川连雁塞西。\n童年方剃削，弱冠导羣迷。\n儒释双披（原作「柀」）翫，声名独见跻。\n须缘随垦请，今乃恨暌携。\n寂寂空愁坐，迟迟落日低。\n触槐常有志，折槛爲无蹊。\n薄暮荒城外，依稀闻远鷄。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}